usage: physa pursue [<idea slug>] [--appetite <tokens>] [--signal-from <file>|-] [--json]

Pursue an idea: put your name on building it, against a signal of four parts (claim, direction, window, resolver). On a terminal the signal is written in $VISUAL or $EDITOR; --signal-from reads it from a file, or stdin for -, and off a terminal it is required. --appetite sets a budget in tokens; with none there is no circuit breaker, and spend is still counted. Only a person pursues: inside an agent's session it is refused. A slug left out is chosen from a list on a terminal.
