       physa check changes [<range>] [--json] [--strict]

Check the map and the changes of a range against it.

Commands:
  map      Check the map: 0 when sound, 1 with problems, 2 when it cannot be read.
  changes  Check each change of a range, and the map as each leaves it.

$ physa check map a b
exit 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
